					type: "choice"
				}
			]
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "泥土的力量真强大"
			tasks: [{
				count: 5L
				id: "674D73073A6152DB"
				item: "undergarden:cloggrum_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "泥土锭"
			x: -1.9285714285714306d
			y: -2.8642857142856997d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["59666E245031C7ED"]
			description: ["&7Deep within the shadowed caverns of the Undergarden, a radiant energy pulses from within the earth—Utherium Crystals. These rare and powerful crystals are prized for their mystical properties, capable of enhancing your tools, weapons, and more. To obtain them, delve into the most dangerous depths, where the air hums with energy and the walls glow faintly with eerie light. Mine these precious crystals with care; their power is immense but not easily tamed. Harness the energy of the Undergarden with Utherium Crystals and unlock your true potential!"]
			id: "0C63004C99406DBD"
			rewards: [
